<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kmart cut to underperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kmart cut to underperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natwest Securities said on Thursday it had lowered its rating on retailer Kmart Corp to underperform from hold.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not provided.</p>
<p>-- Kmart said its consolidated same-store sales for the four-week period ended May 28 increased 2.7 percent and U.S. Kmart sales increased 2.8 percent. Results excluded sales of the discontinued Builders Square operations, it said.</p>
<p>-- The company said its results were below plan mostly because of cold weather.</p>
<p>-- Kmart shares were off 3/8 at 13-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1630))</p>
</text>
